      "paragraphs": [
        "At Pentair, we focus on innovating smart and sustainable pool solutions so you can spend less time worrying and more time enjoying your pool. Customer success is at the heart of our vision for a splash-tastic future, so we've crafted products like energy-efficient pool pumps, automation and lighting that puts full pool control and enjoyment in your hands. Smart. Innovative. Sustainable. Creating amazing poolside memories in the backyard is easy with Pentair.",
        "More Lighting",
        "More Controls",
        "More in Treatment",
        "Curate the dreamiest pool or spa with solutions engineered to filter, clean and condition water for ultimate pool enjoyment. With pool pumps and automation systems for convenient control in one place and lighting and heating to elevate your backyard ambiance under every starry night, we help pool pads become personal paradises.",
        "Whisper-quiet, ENERGY STAR® rated and compliant with updated DOE regulations, products like the IntelliFlo3® Variable Speed and Flow Pool Pump keep pools dive-in ready. Not only did we bring variable speed and flow technology to the industry, but Pentair provides reliability, support and quality products to our customers!",
        "Get the latest in Pentair automation innovation! Products like the IntelliCenter® Control System offer intuitive, effortless control of the features and functions of your pool or spa.",
        "Elevate your pool's overall aesthetics, mood, and presentation with the latest in LED lighting technology. Create a colorful and dreamy ambience with products like the IntelliVibe™ Pool Lighting System.",
        "Keep the pool dive-in ready with high-performing pool and spa filters, along with high-performing replacement cartridges and cleaning tablets to confidently make a splash.",
        "Turn your pool into a wonderful – and warm – experience. With heaters like the ETi® 400 High-Efficiency Pool and Spa Heater, you'll get blazing-fast heat-up times.",
        "Enjoy water that is well-treated. With products like the new and improved IntelliChlor® Plus & LT Salt Chlorine Generators, ordinary table salt can be transformed into chlorine that pools need to be swim-ready.",
        "In-Floor Cleaning & Circulation",
        "Pool Cleaners",
        "Water Features",
        "Pool Valves",
        "White Goods",
        "Pool Maintenance",
        "Aboveground Systems",
        "Replacement Parts",
        "Save more than energy. Act fast to get up to a $200 rebate* on select Pentair pool products.",
        "Many local utility companies offer rebates to pool owners who purchase energy-efficient pool pumps.",
        "Discover each component of your pool pad and what each product does to keep your backyard oasis pool party ready!",
        "Know Your Water. Own Your Water.",
        "Stay smart, connected, and protected with the Pentair Pool app; offering a range of connected products that give you command of your home's water.",
        "The Pentair Pool app and its range of connected products makes managing your pool easier than ever. Control your swimming pool system, monitor water chemistry, and access instant status updates from one easy-to-use dashboard on your smart device. Enjoy energy-efficient solutions and peace of mind with remote monitoring anytime, anywhere.",
        "For Dealers, Distributors and Service Professionals",
        "Partner Portal",
        "We've got the tools and resources you need to do your job more efficiently. Visit the Pentair Portal to get started.",
        "Commercial Pool Solutions",
        "Looking to dip your toes into Pentair's leading solutions for public pools? We’ve got you covered.",
        "We're here to help with any of your product inquiries.",
        "*These TradeGrade products must be purchased from a brick-and-mortar retailer, pool builder, or pool service professional in order to qualify for rebate."
      ],
